<title>FRANCE: Botswana's Masire to visit Paris April 14-16.</title>
<headline>Botswana's Masire to visit Paris April 14-16.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-04-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Botswana President Ketumile Masire will pay an official visit to Paris from April 14 to 16, the foreign ministry confirmed on Saturday.</p>
<p>No details of the president's schedule or purpose of the visit were available.</p>
</text>
